# Excludes this repo's OWN build outputs and caches from the Docker build
# context -- NOT third-party vendored distributables (apps/hub/web/vendor/**
# ships prebuilt dist/ files on purpose; do not add a blanket **/dist rule
# here again, it silently breaks the hosted UI's vite build. See git history
# 2026-09-18.)
node_modules
packages/*/node_modules
apps/*/node_modules
apps/hub/web/node_modules
clients/*/node_modules
examples/*/node_modules
packages/*/dist
apps/hub/dist
apps/hub/web/dist
clients/*/dist
examples/*/dist
.git
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
.venv
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
.playwright-mcp
